sequenceDiagram
    actor Interface as CLI or embedding host
    participant Ops as Shared evaluator operations
    participant DB as Scoped registry
    participant WASM as Blocking Wasm runtime
    participant Host as Optional test authority resolver
    participant HTTP as Core bounded HTTP session
    Interface->>Ops: Bounded canonical input and evaluator identity
    Ops->>DB: Read current accessible artifact and state
    DB-->>Ops: Exact metadata and bounded Wasm bytes
    Note over Ops,DB: Commit and release connection before external work
    Ops->>Ops: Check state and artifact digest
    Ops->>WASM: Compile exact supported ABI under shared admission
    alt Host authority configured
        Ops->>Host: Verified caller, fresh test ID, evaluator ID and digest
        Host-->>Ops: Exact request-bound policy and credentials
    else Default / CLI
        Note over Ops: HTTP remains unavailable
    end
    Ops->>WASM: Execute with immutable optional authority
    opt Evaluator requests HTTP under host authority
        WASM->>HTTP: Request within Wasm deadline
        HTTP->>HTTP: Authorize destination/address, resolve credentials, enforce budgets
        HTTP-->>WASM: Bounded response or explicit error
    end
    WASM-->>Ops: Native measurement/abstention and diagnostics
    Ops->>Ops: Verify returned evaluator identity
    Ops-->>Interface: Typed result, interface owns formatting
